---
const galleryImages = [
  { src: "https://pagesmith-cdn.com/d22f750a/images/39725c_43eab39063f74cca917dd0648078034d~mv2-184.webp", alt: "Wireless home security device" },
  { src: "https://pagesmith-cdn.com/d22f750a/images/39725c_9e8dce94da104095b6cf86e34e32c8de~mv2-184.webp", alt: "Home security panel" },
  { src: "https://pagesmith-cdn.com/d22f750a/images/39725c_87063351514d41efb6ef1dddf67510f3~mv2-184.webp", alt: "Security sensor" },
  { src: "https://pagesmith-cdn.com/d22f750a/images/39725c_ed2a42e00c18406a905836f2db8b6160~mv2-184.webp", alt: "Smart security device" },
  { src: "https://pagesmith-cdn.com/d22f750a/images/39725c_53ffb065439f4ce79efda3cb83bdd75e~mv2-184.webp", alt: "Home security equipment" },
];
---
<section id="in-home-wireless" class="bg-background py-16 lg:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mb-3">
      <span class="text-xs font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-widest" style="color: var(--color-primary);">
        [ Wireless Advantage ]
      </span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-foreground mb-8 reveal"
        style="font-size: var(--text-h2); line-height: 1.1;">
      Why Go Wireless for Your<br />Home Security System?
    </h2>

    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-12">
      <div class="border border-border p-6 reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <p class="text-xs font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3" style="color: var(--color-primary);">
          [ Real-Time Awareness ]
        </p>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed text-sm">
          Wireless systems are more secure and allow you to have real-time awareness and alerts from your home via your mobile app. These systems are increasingly tamper proof because there are no exposed lines that can be cut from outside.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-border p-6 reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <p class="text-xs font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3" style="color: var(--color-primary);">
          [ Remote Monitoring ]
        </p>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed text-sm">
          Your wireless system comes with a phone app you can use to monitor surveillance footage live. Check who's at the door, monitor kids in the backyard, or check on pets while at work — from wherever you are.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-border p-6 reveal reveal-delay-3">
        <p class="text-xs font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3" style="color: var(--color-primary);">
          [ Easy Expansion ]
        </p>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed text-sm">
          As your family grows and evolves, your security needs may as well. It's easy to add new cameras with a wireless system. Let us know what you're looking to protect and we'll help create a system that's just right for you.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Image Gallery -->
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 items-center justify-start mb-10 reveal">
      {galleryImages.map((img) => (
        <div class="border border-border overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src={img.src}
            alt={img.alt}
            width="184"
            class="max-w-[184px] h-auto object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="border border-border p-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-6 reveal">
      <div class="flex-1">
        <p class="font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-foreground mb-1">Ready to Secure Your Home?</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Contact KRE Security to discuss a wireless system tailored to your needs.</p>
      </div>
      <a
        href="/contact/"
        class="inline-block border-2 font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sm px-6 py-3 flex-shrink-0 transition-colors duration-150"
        style="border-color: var(--color-secondary); background-color: var(--color-secondary); color: var(--color-secondary-foreground);"
      >
        Contact Us Today
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
